* Component Created by Javier Petrucci and Agustin Gullino
* jpetrucc@itba.edu.ar / agullino@itba.edu.ar
*
* XOR phase comparator
* Vo = Vcc when exactly one of Vi and Vf is above Vcc/2, 0 otherwise (all referred to ground).
.SUBCKT Phase_Comp_XOR Vi Vf Vo PARAMS: Vcc=5

A1 Vi Vf 0 0 0 0 Vo 0 XOR Vhigh={Vcc}

.ends Phase_Comp_XOR
